  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 36712e6ef0a137f4e86a5d5cf920dff0, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scientist Meeting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  flagOnStart: 
  lines:
  - Doctor|What were you doing out there?!
  - Doctor|... what's that?
  - Doctor|You came here for me?
  - Doctor|I should've figured they'd send some kind of extraction team to retrieve
    me.
  - Doctor|Well, in case you haven't noticed, there doesn't seem to be a great way
    to kill those... things out there.
  - Doctor|That would be my fault. You see, I've been researching a compound to repair
    damaged tissues in the human body for quite a while now.
  - Doctor|Our experiments were going mostly okay, but we experienced a complete
    power outage for a few seconds a couple hours ago, and when power was restored,
    well...
  - Doctor|A couple of our subjects had turned into these... mutants. Likely from
    over-exposure to the compound we've been testing.
  - Doctor|The compound is what keeps them alive. Unfortunately, they're regenerating
    so quickly no gun can kill them.
  - Doctor|We have to remove the compound from their bloodstream.
  - Doctor|Luckily, I've been working on just the tool for this.
  - 'Doctor|A special syringe to extract the compound from their body. '
  - Doctor|I've developed a syringe that can fully extract the compound from their
    veins. The only problem is, these mutants don't seem to enjoy sitting still.
  - Doctor|It's crucial that the syringe be injected deep into the body so it's able
    to pull out all of the compound.
  - Doctor|As you may have noticed, those monsters will sit still if you fire enough
    bullets into their mutated flesh.
  - Doctor|I theorize that may be our only opportunity to extract the compound from
    them.
  - Doctor|Please... I can't do this on my own. Take the syringe, and start vanquishing
    those mutants.
  flagOnEnd: scientist_meeting_end
  autoTime: 0
  overwritable: 0
